Package: nirs4allio
Title: Dataset-Assembly Bridge for the nirs4all Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gregory", "Beurier", email = "gregory.beurier@cirad.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R binding over the nirs4all-io C ABI (n4io_*): normalize inputs into a
    canonical DatasetSpec, infer a DatasetPlan, and validate a DatasetSpec. The
    JSON surface crosses the stable C ABI; results are canonical JSON strings.
License: CeCILL-2.1 | AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
